  "_snapshotNote": "Static fallback for repo clones/crawlers that do not run the server. The live endpoint's GET /.well-known/mcp-server.json is authoritative and may additionally advertise extended/legacy tools if the operator set AGRIOPS_ENABLE_EXTENDED_TOOLS / AGRIOPS_ENABLE_LEGACY_TOOLS=true. Regenerate with `npm run snapshot:well-known`. See docs/anthropic-directory-submission.md."
